  "description": "Three exact counterexamples from the v11 exploration of polyhedral representatives of the HGP dense components (6-7 October 2026): fewer than k added sites can create or merge components of Omega_k(r); identities of contracted chains are not stable under a matched displacement; order-k realizations (barycentric alpha complex, coverage shadow) are not nested in the order-(k-1) alpha complex at the same radius.",
